    "text": "By Stephen Quinn ,\n7 hours ago CAMBRIDGE, MASS. (WHDH) - Police in Cambridge are investigating after several bike riders reported that tacks scattered on the ground throughout a bike lane became stuck in their wheels and damaged their tires. Aaron Levine said he was riding his bike Thursday night when he felt damage to his tire.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
